## Not run, and why

- **A tagged dynamic VLAN.** The case title says "(Un-tag)" and `taggedVlansupplicantNum: 0` was
  recorded throughout; the tagged variant is its own case.
- **`Egress-VLANID` / `Egress-VLAN-Name`** on the local-server group (seen in
  `show radius local-server group`) were left unset; they are a different assignment path.
- **A real RADIUS `Tunnel-Private-Group-ID` from an external server.** The DUT's own local server
  was used, which is the campaign's rig; an external server would test the attribute decode
  rather than the port behaviour.
- **`rule permit|deny` behaviourally** -- see the finding; it could not be configured.
- **Persistence across a reboot**, for the same reason as the rest of group B: it needs `write`,
  and this group's restore contract keeps `startup-config` at `flash:/default.cfg` so that a
  reload is itself a complete restore of group A's rig. Appearance in and disappearance from
  `show running-config` was proved instead.

